  "比较清醒小鼠嗅球输入与输出的活动发现，两者的气味表征有所不同；常用理化描述符只能解释有限的神经响应差异。": "Comparing olfactory-bulb input and output activity in awake mice revealed differences in odor representation. Common physicochemical descriptors explained only a limited share of the variation in neural responses.",
