  "BLA 投向伏隔核和杏仁中央内侧区的细胞群在学习后出现相反的突触变化；选择性刺激分别支持正性或负性强化。": "BLA populations projecting to the nucleus accumbens and centromedial amygdala showed opposing synaptic changes after learning. Selective stimulation supported positive and negative reinforcement, respectively.",
